      "simCaseTitle": "The email was sent, but no one has accepted the case",
      "simCase": "A client complaint arrives at 09:00. At 09:10, Lin in operations forwards it to Ms Chan, the Complaints Officer. At 10:00, Ms Chan has not replied and the complaint remains unresolved.",
